<div class="feed-page static-page static-page--about" data-translation-url="/ar/من-نحن/">

    <header class="feed-header">
        <h1 class="feed-title feed-title-topic">About us</h1>
        <p class="feed-lead">EduNews is an Arabic-language education news platform. We track policy decisions, follow universities, schools and education technology, and explain what it all means for students, parents, teachers and decision makers.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="feature-reading-column">

        <section class="static-section">
            <header class="sec-head"><h2 class="sec-head-title">What we publish</h2></header>
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <p>We cover pre-university and higher education, training and professional development, education technology, and investment in the sector. Our work includes news, in-depth reports and opinion, along with policy watch and morning and evening briefings.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <header class="sec-head"><h2 class="sec-head-title">Our mission</h2></header>
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <p>To put accurate education information in front of readers clearly, so they can make study and career decisions with confidence.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <header class="sec-head"><h2 class="sec-head-title">How we work</h2></header>
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <ul>
                    <li>We verify information before publishing and name our sources.</li>
                    <li>We keep news and opinion clearly separate.</li>
                    <li>We correct mistakes quickly and say when we have.</li>
                    <li>We keep editorial decisions independent of advertisers and sponsors.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

